    "description": "SkyTekx3 content fixes — overrides that neutralise broken third-party data files (patchouli book flag, FFB thermal-cultivation seeds, Create galosphere silver compat recipes, galosphere trim advancement) to silence boot-time parse spam. It also turns off the ores of Railcraft and Immersive Engineering that duplicate the preferred ores of Almost Unified, so each metal has one ore. It also makes the Hexbiscus of Hexxit Gear generate as one single flower in about 1 of 55 chunks, as in SkyTekx 2."
